NC Digital builds custom ecommerce websites for Pontypridd businesses — online stores that are fully designed around your brand and built to sell. We serve businesses across Pontypridd and the wider Rhondda Cynon Taf area, giving you a local team that understands the market.

Ecommerce sites start from **£800**, depending on your chosen platform, how many products you're selling, and the functionality you need.

## Which ecommerce platform is right for your Pontypridd business?

We work across three platforms and recommend the right one based on your products and goals. Every build is fully custom-designed — no templates.

**Shopify** — fast, scalable, and easy to manage day-to-day. Ideal for Pontypridd product businesses wanting a professional store with low ongoing maintenance. Custom-designed from scratch.

**WooCommerce** — WordPress-based, highly flexible, and a strong choice for businesses that need bespoke features or are already running a WordPress site. Fully custom-designed.

**SureCart** — well-suited for digital products, subscriptions, or service businesses taking online payments. Modern, lightweight, and fully custom-designed.

## What's included in every build

- Fully custom design — your brand, your products, your store
- Mobile-first — optimised for smartphone shoppers
- Secure checkout and payment gateway integration
- Product management — add and edit products yourself post-launch
- On-page SEO for product and category pages
- Google Analytics and conversion tracking from day one

## Selling beyond Pontypridd

An ecommerce site means your Pontypridd business can sell to customers across South Wales, across the UK, and beyond. We build stores that are ready to grow with you.

